{"version":1,"page":{"kind":"gloss-detail","href":"/shijing/gloss/047-jun-zi-xie-lao/quwanli-quanshi/0002-1","dataHref":"/__data/shijing/gloss/047-jun-zi-xie-lao/quwanli-quanshi/0002-1/data.json","title":"詩經詮釋 · 君子偕老，副笄六珈。委委佗佗，如山如河。象服是宜。子之不淑，云如之何！玼兮玼兮，其之翟也。鬒髮如雲，不屑髢也。玉之瑱也，象之揥也，揚且之晳也。胡然而天也？胡然而帝也？瑳兮瑳兮，其之展也。蒙彼縐絺，是紲袢也。子之清揚，揚且之顏也。展如之人兮，邦之媛也。 · 屈万里 · 注释","description":"風 · 鄘風 · 君子偕老 · 《詩經詮釋》关于“君子偕老，副笄六珈。委委佗佗，如山如河。象服是宜…”的注脚：屈万里释“偕”为俱；“副”“笄”“珈”为夫人首饰。又释“委委佗佗”即逶迤，言行路纡曲而缓从容；“如山如河”状气象安重弘广；“象服”为王后诸侯夫人…"},"payload":{"detail":{"route":{"poemId":"047-jun-zi-xie-lao","materialId":"quwanli-quanshi","glossId":"0002-1"},"href":"/shijing/gloss/047-jun-zi-xie-lao/quwanli-quanshi/0002-1","poem":{"id":"047-jun-zi-xie-lao","title":"君子偕老","categoryId":"feng","subcategoryId":"yongfeng","path":["風","鄘風","君子偕老"],"segments":[{"id":"seg-001","text":"君子偕老","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-002","text":"副笄六珈","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-003","text":"委委佗佗","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-004","text":"如山如河","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-005","text":"象服是宜","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-006","text":"子之不淑","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-007","text":"云如之何","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-008","text":"玼兮玼兮","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-009","text":"其之翟也","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-010","text":"鬒髮如雲","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-011","text":"不屑髢也","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-012","text":"玉之瑱也","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-013","text":"象之揥也","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-014","text":"揚且之晳也","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-015","text":"胡然而天也","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-016","text":"胡然而帝也","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-017","text":"瑳兮瑳兮","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-018","text":"其之展也","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-019","text":"蒙彼縐絺","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-020","text":"是紲袢也","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-021","text":"子之清揚","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-022","text":"揚且之顏也","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-023","text":"展如之人兮","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-024","text":"邦之媛也","isActive":true}]},"material":{"id":"quwanli-quanshi","title":"詩經詮釋","authors"